<title>USA: Omaha cattle $.50-1.00 lower in slow trade - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle $.50-1.00 lower in slow trade - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were $.50-1.00 lower in slow trade on Tuesday, USDA said.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Part load reputation fed Choice 2-4 1250 lbs 68.50. Select to Choice 1100-1300 lbs 66.50-68.00. Select 62.00-66.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs 66.50-68.00. Select 62.00-68.00.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
